        <span id="annotation">
            <dt>Annotation</dt><dd>IM general only; not a routine coordinate for specific neoplasms in experimental animals; policy: Manual 24.5+; <a id='chem_ind' class='textLink_chem_ind' href='/record/ui?ui=Q000139'>/&zwnj;chem&nbsp;ind</a>: Manual 24.5.6+; spontaneous: Manual 24.5.5</dd>
