                <span id="scopeNote">
                    <dt>Scope Note</dt><dd>Experimentally induced new abnormal growth of <a href="/record/ui?ui=D014024" class="textLink_TISSUES">TISSUES</a> in animals to provide models for studying human neoplasms.</dd>
